  "edibilityNote": {
    "value": "Contains the hallucinogens psilocybin and psilocin, which can cause vomiting, stomach pains and anxiety attacks (First Nature). Like the Liberty Cap, it is a Class A drug in the UK: illegal to pick or keep.",
